      "text": "- **One job per reel.** Traffic reels reach strangers; nurture reels warm followers; neither sells. Selling happens in stories, DMs, and long form.\n- **Topic beats hook mechanics.** \"When your topic is [bad] nothing will work.\" Hooks matter (outcome + specificity + speed), but idea selection is the lever.\n- **Niche the topics, always** — with the ratified TOF exception: top-of-funnel may lean broad enough for the algorithm (the ICP-x-dream-follower overlap), never below it.\n- **Formats saturate in 6-12 months.** Copying last year's winning format fails; the meta-skill is reinvention (format invention pipeline, pending).\n- **Raw beats polished** (founder-ratified dial 4). Production touches are amplifiers (music, light edits), never the baseline. At high credibility, deliberately cycling back to raw earns respect every 3-6 months.\n- **Cadence:** ~1 original recording session feeding derivative clips; reels post daily-ish as derivatives of long form, not as daily inventions."
