      "text": "1. **Methodology-as-document** (the grow-acquisition carousel): cover (hook + proof wall) -> N numbered pillar slides, each = ghost number + bold title + one-sentence promise + a staged photo carrying a real artifact (dashboard, doc, chat journey, notifications) -> CTA slide (close from abundance + trigger word). This packages an entire offer/process as a scroll — a landing-page alternative. For Pulsify: the Pulse System's pillars templated exactly this way.\n\n2. **Taxonomy/matrix** (the 964k carousel): cover (specific-number hook) -> one slide per type/item, each with a definition + at-a-glance chips (a 3-chip color code: e.g. cadence / function / audience) + a real example mockup -> final CTA slide with a live proof element (a reach donut). This teaches a whole framework for free and sells the deeper version. The chip system is the reusable innovation.\n\n3. **Philosophy/concept set** (the 7-lessons carousel): cover -> N one-word concept slides, each a single belief-shift over a cinematic photo, big drop-shadow typography -> the last concept doubles as thesis/close. Packages beliefs as a saveable set; the carousel equivalent of a value/breakdown story sequence."
